WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.600
This is the second part of the timetable meeting.

00:03.600 --> 00:08.120
We now talk about the weekend trains.

20:00.400 --> 20:05.000
On Saturdays the first train leaves one hour later.

59:54.000 --> 59:59.200
On Sundays two more trains run in the summer.

59:59.200 --> 01:00:01.500
Any questions?

01:00:01.500 --> 01:00:06.880
Yes, the timetable starts on the first of December.

